uipment":{"weapon":"WP12006","armor":"WP1000405","helmet":"WP1019405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1043","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[69,74,33,41,41,67],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"55","reputation":"1000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12006","armor":"WP1000405","helmet":"WP1019405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1043","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[69,74,33,41,41,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12006","armor":"WP1000405","helmet":"WP1019405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10120","city":"CS1043","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[69,74,33,41,41,67],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12006","armor":"WP1000405","helmet":"WP1019405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"孟获麾下武将，第二洞部队的统帅。董荼那随孟获对抗诸葛亮期间，被蜀将张嶷所擒，但又被放还。后又奉命进攻蜀军时，董荼那抵不住马岱的责备，故撤兵。董荼那归来后，引起了孟获的怀疑，于是被其惩罚，不满的董荼那便与其余属下将孟获捆绑后交予蜀军。孟获又被诸葛亮放还后，董荼那亦被孟获仇杀。","tc":"孟獲麾下武將，第二洞部隊的統帥。董荼那隨孟獲對抗諸葛亮期間，被蜀將張嶷所擒，但又被放還。后又奉命進攻蜀軍時，董荼那抵不住馬岱的責備，故撤兵。董荼那歸來后，引起了孟獲的懷疑，于是被其懲罰，不滿的董荼那便與其余屬下將孟獲捆綁后交予蜀軍。孟獲又被諸葛亮放還后，董荼那亦被孟獲仇殺。","en":"Officer under Meng Huo and commander of the Second Cave forces. During the conflict with Zhuge Liang, Dong Tuna was captured by the Shu general Zhang Ni but was released. When later ordered to attack the Shu army again, he was so cowed by Ma Dai's reproach that he withdrew his forces. Upon his return, Meng Huo suspected treachery and had him punished. The disgruntled Dong Tuna then conspired with other subordinates to bind Meng Huo and deliver him to the Shu camp. After Zhuge Liang released Meng Huo once more, Dong Tuna was killed by Meng Huo in retaliation.","jp":"孟獲配下の武将で、第二洞部隊の統帥。董荼那は孟獲に従って諸葛亮に対抗した際、蜀将の張嶷に捕らえられるも釈放された。その後、再び命を受けて蜀軍を攻めたが、馬岱からの叱責に耐えかねて兵を引いた。帰陣後、孟獲の疑いを招いて処罰されたため、不満を抱いた董荼那は他の配下と共に孟獲を縛り上げて蜀軍に引き渡した。しかし、諸葛亮によって孟獲が再び釈放されると、董荼那は孟獲によって報復され、殺害された。","kr":"맹획 휘하의 무장이자 제2동 부대의 통솔자입니다. 맹획을 따라 제갈량에게 맞서던 중 촉장 장의에게 사로잡혔으나 풀려났습니다. 이후 다시 명을 받고 촉군을 공격하러 나섰을 때, 마대의 질책을 견디지 못하고 군사를 물렸습니다. 돌아온 뒤 맹획의 의심을 사 처벌을 받자, 이에 불만을 품고 다른 부하들과 함께 맹획을 결박하여 촉군에 넘겼습니다. 그러나 맹획이 제갈량에게 다시 풀려난 뒤, 원한을 품은 맹획에게 보복을 당해 살해되었습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10433","remark":"","surname":"董","surnameTc":"董","surnameEn":"Dong","surnameJp":"董","surnameKr":"동","surnameOther":"","name":"荼那","nameTc":"荼那","nameEn":"Tu Na","nameJp":"荼那","nameKr":"도나","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"董荼那","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"217","city":"CS1043","gender":"0","rule":"69","force":"74","wise":"33","politics":"41","charm":"41","will":"67","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"2","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"3","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"25/25/25/72/25/9/50/25","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1007705","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4700","battleSoulPoint":"5400","debateSoulPoint":"1000","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"3/1/0/0/0/0/2/0/0/0/0/0/2/0/0/0/0/0/0/0/0/2/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"41","loyalty":"0","reputation":"350","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"189","show":"217","death":"225","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP12006","armor":"